  ],
  "steps": [
    "Cook the moong dal with turmeric and 2 cups of water until soft and mushy.",
    "Add the pumpkin and salt, and cook until the pumpkin is tender, adding water if needed.",
    "Grind the coconut, green chilli and cumin seeds to a coarse paste with a splash of water.",
    "Stir the paste into the dal-pumpkin mixture and simmer for 5 minutes, lightly mashing some pumpkin.",
    "Heat the oil, crackle the mustard seeds, then add urad dal, dried red chilli and curry leaves and fry until the dal is golden.",
    "Pour the tempering over the kootu and mix gently."
  ]
